{'symbol': 'ES', 'date': '2022-12-07 16:22:00', 'title': 'EVERSOURCE AGAIN RANKS AS THE #1 UTILITY FOR CORPORATE RESPONSIBILITY BY NEWSWEEK', 'text': "HARTFORD, CONN. & BOSTON--( BUSINESS WIRE )--FOR THE THIRD TIME IN THE LAST FOUR YEARS, EVERSOURCE ENERGY (NYSE: ES) HAS BEEN RECOGNIZED BY NEWSWEEK MAGAZINE AS THE TOP UTILITY IN ITS ANNUAL LIST OF AMERICA'S MOST RESPONSIBLE COMPANIES, IN RECOGNITION OF ITS NATIONAL LEADERSHIP IN PROMOTING CORPORATE SOCIAL RESPONSIBILITY, SUSTAINABILITY AND CORPORATE CITIZENSHIP."}